# Lucky Orange

> Lucky Orange is a website behavior analytics platform trusted by over 500,000 websites worldwide. It combines heatmaps, session recordings, conversion funnels, form analytics, surveys, live chat, and Discovery AI into a connected suite that helps teams understand why visitors aren't converting — and what to fix first. Every tool is included in every plan. Lucky Orange is designed for e-commerce brands, SaaS marketers, agencies, and anyone who wants to move from raw data to actionable website optimization.

Lucky Orange gives you heatmaps, funnels, and session recordings — plus Discovery AI to connect them into a direct answer for what to fix first. Unlike Google Analytics, Lucky Orange shows the "why" behind the numbers by capturing real visitor behavior at the individual session level. Plans start with a free tier (100 monthly sessions) and scale to enterprise. A 7-day free trial is available on all paid plans with no credit card required.

## Core Product Pages

- [Home](https://www.luckyorange.com/): Overview of Lucky Orange — heatmaps, session recordings, funnels, surveys, and Discovery AI. Includes a step-by-step workflow and FAQs.
- [Discovery AI](https://www.luckyorange.com/discovery): Lucky Orange's AI layer that reads live visitor behavior data and returns specific, evidence-backed answers about what's hurting conversions. Includes Suggested Actions (pre-built audit prompts) and a Heatmap Analysis Quick Action. Integrates with Shopify checkout events. Compared directly to generic LLMs like ChatGPT/Claude/Gemini.
- [Dynamic Heatmaps](https://www.luckyorange.com/website-heatmap-tool): Click, scroll, and move heatmaps that work on dynamic page elements — popups, dropdowns, carousels — unlike legacy static heatmap tools. Works with SPAs, AJAX, and modern frameworks (React, etc.). Supports device filtering (mobile/tablet/desktop) and audience segmentation by UTM, traffic source, and more.
- [Session Recordings](https://www.luckyorange.com/recordings): Watch replay of individual visitor journeys including clicks, scrolls, and form interactions. Filterable by cart value, traffic source, UTM, and pre-built segments like "frustrated visitors." Includes a Live View mode for real-time monitoring and links to Visitor Profiles.
- [Analytics](https://www.luckyorange.com/analytics): Three connected analytics modules — Analytics Dashboard (real-time traffic, page, and device overview), Page Insights (per-page behavior including bounce rate, device breakdown, and top clicks), and Form Analytics (field-level drop-off, time-on-field, and device breakdowns for forms).
- [Communicate](https://www.luckyorange.com/communicate): Lucky Orange's communication tools — Live Chat (proactive, triggered by visitor behavior with full session context), On-Site Surveys (targeted by exit intent, UTM, scroll depth, and time on page), and Announcements (behavior-targeted messages for returning or high-intent visitors).
- [Surveys](https://www.luckyorange.com/surveys): Standalone survey product page. Multi-question surveys with numerous trigger options (exit intent, UTM source, scroll depth, time on page). Includes powerful reporting with per-visitor response linking.
- [Pricing](https://www.luckyorange.com/pricing): Six plan tiers — Free ($0, 100 sessions/mo), Build ($32/mo, 3,500 sessions), Grow ($72/mo, 10,000 sessions), Expand ($199/mo, 50,000 sessions), Scale ($839/mo, 300,000 sessions), Enterprise (custom, 700,000+ sessions). Annual billing saves 20%. Every feature is included in every plan (Discovery AI, heatmaps, recordings, surveys, live chat, funnels, form analytics, announcements). Data storage starts at 30 days (Free) and 60+ days on paid plans.

## Integrations

- [All Integrations](https://www.luckyorange.com/integrations): Full list of integrations including BigCommerce, Google Analytics (GA4), HubSpot, Optimizely, Square, Shopify, WordPress, Zapier, Google Tag Manager, Magento, Wix, Webflow, ClickFunnels, Squarespace, phpBB, Unbounce, neto.
- [Shopify Integration](https://www.luckyorange.com/integrations/shopify): Deep Shopify integration — automatic conversion funnel tracking (add-to-cart, checkout), cart value segmentation, and Shopify Plus checkout page heatmaps and recordings. Lucky Orange is described as the only tool that tracks and optimizes the Shopify Plus hosted checkout.

